{"slug":"hospitalized-child","title":"住院兒童的反應與護理","subtitle":"The hospitalized child — stressors of hospitalization, separation anxiety (protest, despair, detachment), age-specific reactions and nursing care, communicating with children, therapeutic play versus play therapy, preparation for procedures and surgery, children's concepts of pain, and supporting parents and siblings","category":"care","aliases":["住院兒童","兒童住院反應","住院壓力","Hospitalized child","分離焦慮","Separation anxiety","抗議期","失望期","絕望期","去依戀期","否認期","Protest","Despair","Detachment","Bowlby","Robertson","失去控制力","身體完整性","退化行為","治療性遊戲","Therapeutic play","遊戲治療","Play therapy","情緒宣洩性遊戲","指導性遊戲","生理健康促進性遊戲","醫療遊戲","第三者技巧","三個願望","醫院之旅","術前準備","兒童疼痛概念","手足","住院兒童的手足","遊戲室"],"dzTags":["分離焦慮","兒童住院反應"],"admTags":[],"system":"fundamentals","alsoIn":["psychiatric"],"group":"child-health","reviewed":false,"updated":"2026-10-27","references":[{"title":"華杏《實用兒科護理》第 4 章住院兒童之反應及其護理(書頁 185–212)","note":"僅作為撰寫參考，本頁文字為重新整理撰寫"},{"title":"Robertson J, Bowlby J. Responses of young children to separation from their mothers. Courrier du Centre International de l'Enfance 1952;2:131–142","note":"分離反應三階段(抗議、失望、去依戀)"},{"title":"Vessey JA, Mahon MM. Therapeutic play and the hospitalized child. J Pediatr Nurs 1990;5(5):328–333","note":"治療性遊戲三類"},{"title":"Committee on Fetus and Newborn and Section on Anesthesiology and Pain Medicine. Prevention and Management of Procedural Pain in the Neonate：An Update. Pediatrics 2016;137(2):e20154271","url":"https://doi.org/10.1542/peds.2015-4271","note":"新生兒會痛，反覆疼痛有長期影響"},{"title":"國考歷屆題與 AI 詳解","note":"只用來判斷考點"}],"chapters":["兒科-Ch05住院兒童之反應及其護理 > 住院兒童的壓力反應","兒科-Ch05住院兒童之反應及其護理 > 協助兒童及家庭因應住院壓力","兒科-Ch05住院兒童之反應及其護理 > 住院過程中的護理"],"intro":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"住院對兒童與家庭都是一個危機：離開熟悉的環境、接受不願意的處置、身體受到限制與疼痛。護理人員要依年齡評估壓力源與反應，並協助兒童與家庭把壓力降到最低。本頁整理住院壓力源、分離焦慮、各年齡的反應與護理、溝通技巧、治療性遊戲、處置與手術前的準備、兒童的疼痛概念，以及父母與手足；兒童的認知與心理社會發展見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"child-growth-development#theories"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"發展理論"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，疼痛評估量表與止痛藥見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"pain-management#children"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"兒童"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，慢性病兒童見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"chronically-ill-children"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"慢性病兒童與家庭的護理：以家庭為中心、正常化與學校適應"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，瀕死兒童見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"end-of-life-care#children"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"兒童與死亡"}]}]}]},"sections":[{"id":"summary","depth":2,"number":"一、","title":"重點摘要","children":[{"id":"exam-points","depth":3,"number":"(一)","title":"國考常考點","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"哭喊要媽媽、拒絕護理師、踢打 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"抗議期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；安靜、沉默、對事物沒興趣 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"失望期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；接受護理師、父母離開也不在意 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"去依戀期"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"幼兒"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不會用合理化"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，面對限制多出現退化或抗議"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"幼兒在發展自主，但不能問「要不要做檢查」，要給「先量體溫還是先看耳朵」這種選擇"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"學齡前："},{"type":"element","